  - kind: ManualTaskInput
    propertyName: organization
    value: https://orgede4fce2.crm.dynamics.com

  - kind: ManualTaskInput
    propertyName: entityName
    value: new_patients

  - kind: AutomaticTaskInput
    propertyName: "'$filter'"
    description: |-
      OData filter to check if this exact patient already exists, matching BOTH phone number AND name together (not phone alone, since multiple patients can share a household phone number). Use exact lowercase field names: new_phonenumber and new_patientname. Example:

      new_phonenumber eq '03001234567' and new_patientname eq 'Test Patient'

modelDisplayName: Find Patient
modelDescription: |-
  Checks if a patient already exists in the system by matching BOTH phone 
  number and name together, to avoid creating duplicate patient records 
  while preventing different patients who share a household phone number 
  from being incorrectly matched to the same record.
